Quality Analytics & Continuous Improvement: Analyst Upskilling Program
Welcome to the Quality Analytics Upskilling Program. As a data analyst, your role extends beyond simply reporting numbers; you are expected to identify root causes, predict future performance, and drive process optimization. This self-paced syllabus is designed to bridge standard data analysis with Lean Six Sigma and Quality Management principles, equipping you with the tools to solve complex business problems systematically.

